Package: com.qn.lsnowplayingrepeat
Name: LSNowPlayingRepeat
Version: 1.3.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Lock Screen and Control Center Now Playing get a Repeat button for Apple Music, YouTube Music and Spotify (tap = Off/All/One). iOS 17.1+: replaces Favorite, long-press = Favorite. iOS 16–17.0: replaces the audio output button, long-press = output picker.
Maintainer: Qn
Author: Qn
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 16.0)
